<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>JHY's Blog</title><link>https://imjhy.com/</link><description>Recent content on JHY's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</managingEditor><webMaster>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</webMaster><copyright>© 2026 Hongyu Jiang</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://imjhy.com/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>树杈间的猫</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/</link><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="树杈间的猫"&#10; width="1706"&#10; height="1279"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/feature_5aadd313245a53434ce74b5f2503b4ca_hu_8f14945752cd74a7.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/feature_5aadd313245a53434ce74b5f2503b4ca_hu_8f14945752cd74a7.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/feature_5aadd313245a53434ce74b5f2503b4ca_hu_1dc7cc161b89fd04.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/feature_5aadd313245a53434ce74b5f2503b4ca.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;习惯敏锐于自己缺失的，迟钝于自己拥有的。细数种种，我本就完满。&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-08-neko-between-branches/feature_5aadd313245a53434ce74b5f2503b4ca.jpg"/></item><item><title>回来</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="回来"&#10; width="1279"&#10; height="1706"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/feature_eac8f56ea2661b18a81f9a3b1c36031e_hu_e875b2918fe5c0c2.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/feature_eac8f56ea2661b18a81f9a3b1c36031e_hu_e875b2918fe5c0c2.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/feature_eac8f56ea2661b18a81f9a3b1c36031e.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/feature_eac8f56ea2661b18a81f9a3b1c36031e.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-10-07-back/feature_eac8f56ea2661b18a81f9a3b1c36031e.jpg"/></item><item><title>休息</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-27-rest/</link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-27-rest/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;从鼓楼到仙林，地铁通勤需要将近一个小时。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;头几次去仙林之前，我会想，这两小时我该「干点啥」呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>上海</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;终于有时间回顾七月底的上海之行。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;时隔十年的「故地重游」。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="出发"&#10; width="1279"&#10; height="1706"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;出发&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;第一晚&#10; &lt;div id="第一晚" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e6%99%9a" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;酒店在五角场旁边。晚上七点，办好入住就没事了。想着来了上海好歹去线下体验体验，于是决定外出吃晚饭。&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/feature.jpg"/></item><item><title>彼岸花</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 12:22:17 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="彼岸花"&#10; width="4320"&#10; height="5760"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_f24f088de36ea006.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_f24f088de36ea006.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217_hu_c3728b9c15d86d6d.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-09-06-lycoris/feature_IMG_20260906_122217.jpg"/></item><item><title>孤独的 JVM</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:09:10 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="孤独的 java 虚拟机"&#10; width="4320"&#10; height="5760"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/featured_hu_9d65dd2100ff4ee3.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/featured_hu_9d65dd2100ff4ee3.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/featured_hu_cbedce0e9e6d9854.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/featured.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-08-30-lonely-java/featured.jpg"/></item><item><title>湖山衔日渡轻舟</title><link>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 16:47:55 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="湖山衔日渡轻舟"&#10; width="4320"&#10; height="5760"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/feature_IMG_20260110_164755-2102eb7d3c9c_hu_c3dc560e91ec1af6.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/feature_IMG_20260110_164755-2102eb7d3c9c_hu_c3dc560e91ec1af6.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/feature_IMG_20260110_164755-2102eb7d3c9c_hu_e8a8c1fe5af5afe6.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/feature_IMG_20260110_164755-2102eb7d3c9c.jpg"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/gallery/2026-01-10-west-lake/feature_IMG_20260110_164755-2102eb7d3c9c.jpg"/></item><item><title>一年一句</title><link>https://imjhy.com/one-year-one-line/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/one-year-one-line/</guid><description>&lt;div class="lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl"&gt;&#10; 与 QQ 个性签名同步。&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;实迷途其未远，觉今是而昨非。&lt;em&gt;（2026-01-01）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;既窈窕以寻壑，亦崎岖而经丘。&lt;em&gt;（2025-01-01）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;莫学武陵人，暂游桃源里。&lt;em&gt;（2024-01-01）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;跻攀寸步千险，一落百寻轻。&lt;em&gt;（2023-01-01）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;天接云涛连晓雾，星河欲转千帆舞。&lt;em&gt;（2022-01-01）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;在阳光和云影隐现的路上 / 徐缓地走着而感到单纯地欢喜 &lt;em&gt;（2021-08-03）&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div&#10; id="accordion-97aa97a3c913bb7a78cdea6676425ab3"&#10; class="space-y-2"&#10; data-accordion="collapse"&#10; data-accordion-separated="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&#10; class="group rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 overflow-hidden"&#10; data-accordion-item&#10; &#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-left text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&gt;归去来兮辞（东晋 · 陶渊明）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="accordion-chevron ms-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center print:hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg&#10; xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&#10; viewBox="0 0 20 20"&#10; fill="currentColor"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;path&#10; fill-rule="evenodd"&#10; d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"&#10; clip-rule="evenodd"&#10; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/summary&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="px-4 pb-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"&gt;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;余家贫，耕植不足以自给。幼稚盈室，瓶无储粟，生生所资，未见其术。亲故多劝余为长吏，脱然有怀，求之靡途。会有四方之事，诸侯以惠爱为德，家叔以余贫苦，遂见用于小邑。于时风波未静，心惮远役，彭泽去家百里，公田之利，足以为酒。故便求之。及少日，眷然有归欤之情。何则？质性自然，非矫厉所得。饥冻虽切，违己交病。尝从人事，皆口腹自役。于是怅然慷慨，深愧平生之志。犹望一稔，当敛裳宵逝。寻程氏妹丧于武昌，情在骏奔，自免去职。仲秋至冬，在官八十余日。因事顺心，命篇曰《归去来兮》。乙巳岁十一月也。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;归去来兮，田园将芜胡不归？既自以心为形役，奚惆怅而独悲？&lt;strong&gt;悟已往之不谏，知来者之可追。&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;实迷途其未远，觉今是而昨非。&lt;/strong&gt; 舟遥遥以轻飏，风飘飘而吹衣。问征夫以前路，恨晨光之熹微。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;乃瞻衡宇，载欣载奔。僮仆欢迎，稚子候门。三径就荒，松菊犹存。携幼入室，有酒盈樽。引壶觞以自酌，眄庭柯以怡颜。倚南窗以寄傲，审容膝之易安。园日涉以成趣，门虽设而常关。策扶老以流憩，时矫首而遐观。云无心以出岫，鸟倦飞而知还。景翳翳以将入，抚孤松而盘桓。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;归去来兮，请息交以绝游。世与我而相违，复驾言兮焉求？悦亲戚之情话，乐琴书以消忧。农人告余以春及，将有事于西畴。或命巾车，或棹孤舟。既窈窕以寻壑，亦崎岖而经丘。木欣欣以向荣，泉涓涓而始流。善万物之得时，感吾生之行休。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;已矣乎！寓形宇内复几时？曷不委心任去留？胡为乎遑遑欲何之？富贵非吾愿，帝乡不可期。怀良辰以孤往，或植杖而耘耔。登东皋以舒啸，临清流而赋诗。聊乘化以归尽，乐夫天命复奚疑！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&#10; class="group rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 overflow-hidden"&#10; data-accordion-item&#10; &#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-left text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&gt;崔九欲往南山马上口号与别 （唐 · 裴迪）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="accordion-chevron ms-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center print:hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg&#10; xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&#10; viewBox="0 0 20 20"&#10; fill="currentColor"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;path&#10; fill-rule="evenodd"&#10; d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"&#10; clip-rule="evenodd"&#10; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/summary&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="px-4 pb-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"&gt;&#10; 归山深浅去，须尽丘壑美。&#10;莫学武陵人，暂游桃源里。&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&#10; class="group rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 overflow-hidden"&#10; data-accordion-item&#10; &#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-left text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&gt;水调歌头 · 昵昵儿女语 （宋 · 苏轼）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="accordion-chevron ms-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center print:hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg&#10; xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&#10; viewBox="0 0 20 20"&#10; fill="currentColor"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;path&#10; fill-rule="evenodd"&#10; d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"&#10; clip-rule="evenodd"&#10; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/summary&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="px-4 pb-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"&gt;&#10; &lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;欧阳文忠公尝问余：「琴诗何者最善？」答以退之听颖师琴诗最善。公曰：此诗最奇丽，然非听琴，乃听琵琶也。余深然之。建安章质夫家善琵琶者，乞为歌词。余久不作，特取退之词，稍加隐括，使就声律，以遗之云。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;昵昵儿女语，灯火夜微明。恩怨尔汝来去，弹指泪和声。忽变轩昂勇士，一鼓填然作气，千里不留行。回首暮云远，飞絮搅青冥。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;众禽里，真彩凤，独不鸣。&lt;strong&gt;跻攀寸步千险，一落百寻轻。&lt;/strong&gt; 烦子指间风雨，置我肠中冰炭，起坐不能平。推手从归去，无泪与君倾。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&#10; class="group rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 overflow-hidden"&#10; data-accordion-item&#10; &#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-left text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&gt;渔家傲 · 记梦 （宋 · 李清照）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="accordion-chevron ms-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center print:hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg&#10; xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&#10; viewBox="0 0 20 20"&#10; fill="currentColor"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;path&#10; fill-rule="evenodd"&#10; d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"&#10; clip-rule="evenodd"&#10; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/summary&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="px-4 pb-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;天接云涛连晓雾，星河欲转千帆舞。&lt;/strong&gt; 仿佛梦魂归帝所。闻天语，殷勤问我归何处。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;我报路长嗟日暮，学诗谩有惊人句。九万里风鹏正举。风休住，蓬舟吹取三山去！&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;details&#10; class="group rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 overflow-hidden"&#10; data-accordion-item&#10; &#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-left text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-2"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&gt;秋日游 （艾青）&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="accordion-chevron ms-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center print:hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg&#10; xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&#10; viewBox="0 0 20 20"&#10; fill="currentColor"&#10; aria-hidden="true"&#10;&gt;&#10; &lt;path&#10; fill-rule="evenodd"&#10; d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z"&#10; clip-rule="evenodd"&#10; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/summary&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="px-4 pb-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;爱看晴朗的秋日的云影走过的草原，&lt;br&gt;&#10;草原的低洼处&lt;br&gt;&#10;星散着白色的山羊，&lt;br&gt;&#10;它们各自啮啃着青草，&lt;br&gt;&#10;没有一个人去看管；&lt;br&gt;&#10;新筑的黄土公路沿着小溪&lt;br&gt;&#10;弯进了杂色的树林，&lt;br&gt;&#10;又出现在远方的&lt;br&gt;&#10;照着阳光的山坡上……&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;我们不是去访久别的朋友，&lt;br&gt;&#10;只因为这是初次走的路&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;strong&gt;在云影和阳光隐现的路上&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;strong&gt;徐缓地走着而感到单纯的欢喜……&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;云团在空中腾涌着&lt;br&gt;&#10;从太阳光里却飘下雨滴，&lt;br&gt;&#10;雨，随着愈下愈大了，&lt;br&gt;&#10;但四方的原野&lt;br&gt;&#10;却仍在阳光里伸展着；&lt;br&gt;&#10;我们在一个山村旁边的&lt;br&gt;&#10;几棵大树的根上坐下躲雨。&lt;br&gt;&#10;雨却又像急速的行军转向北方去了……&lt;br&gt;&#10;此刻留下的是润湿的凉气……&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;踏上闪着水光的石板路&lt;br&gt;&#10;走过新造的石桥&lt;br&gt;&#10;走过一个山岗&lt;br&gt;&#10;那大树林就以它的无边的荫影&lt;br&gt;&#10;迎接了我们——&lt;br&gt;&#10;这是一个由榉子树、樟树、松树&lt;br&gt;&#10;和各种不知名的树挤集成的树林啊……&lt;br&gt;&#10;当我们跨进了树林，&lt;br&gt;&#10;在草地上坐下时，&lt;br&gt;&#10;我们就惊乱了无数的白色的鹭鸶鸟——&lt;br&gt;&#10;它们拍着翅膀&lt;br&gt;&#10;嘴里发出鸣叫&lt;br&gt;&#10;在丛密的绿色中飞起——&lt;br&gt;&#10;它们大概是久久栖息在这里的隐世者吧。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;一九三八年八月初 衡山&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>友链</title><link>https://imjhy.com/links/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/links/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;欢迎交换友链～&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>